              "lightning:padding" : "{!$brand.spacing.none}",
              "lightning:typography" : "{!$brand.typography.paragraph.paragraph1}",
              "text" : "At Zeta, love is the foundation of an extraordinary education. For eight years, our top-performing, tuition-free public charter schools have served New York City families through rigorous academics and meaningful opportunities that nurture the whole child."
