                "letterSpacing" : "normal",
                "lineHeight" : 1.5,
                "textTransform" : "none"
              },
              "text" : "<font face=\"Tahoma\">As founder, my vision for Zeta grew out of the kind of school my husband and I wanted for our three sons: a school where students receive an excellent education, develop a lifelong love of learning, and grow in confidence, curiosity, and character. My ten-year-old son attends Zeta, so I experience our schools every day as both a Zeta leader and a proud Zeta parent.<br /></font>"
