          },
          "definition" : "lightning/column",
          "id" : "9af07a8f-aa74-4c30-aa64-58446531dbd5",
          "type" : "block",
          "children" : [ {
            "attributes" : {
              "align" : "start",
              "lightning:borderRadius" : "{!$brand.borderRadius.square}",
              "lightning:borderWidth" : "{!$brand.borderWeight.none}",
              "lightning:colorGroup" : {
                "backgroundColor" : "{!$brand.colorScheme.root}",
                "borderColor" : "{!$brand.colorScheme.neutral}",
                "linkColor" : "#0054A6",
                "textColor" : "{!$brand.colorScheme.contrast}"
              },
              "lightning:margin" : "{!$brand.spacing.none}",
              "lightning:padding" : "{!$brand.spacing.none}",
              "lightning:typography" : {
                "fontFamily" : "{!$cms.BrandonGrotesque_Medium}",
                "fontSize" : "{!$brand.fontSize.medium}",
                "fontWeight" : "{!$brand.fontWeight.normal}",
                "letterSpacing" : "normal",
                "lineHeight" : 1.5,
                "textTransform" : "none"
              },
              "text" : "<font face=\"Tahoma\">Our commitment is to provide your child with a world-class educational experience grounded in love, from pre-kindergarten through twelfth grade. Across Zeta's schools last year, 92% of students passed the New York State Math exams, with nearly half earning the highest score of 4. In English Language Arts, 86% passed—50 percentage points above local district averages and 36 percentage points above New York City's average. In Science, 92% passed, Zeta's strongest result since the state introduced its more rigorous Next Generation standards. <br /><br />In the months ahead, you will discover the many possibilities for your child at Zeta: exceptional academics that engage and inspire brilliant young minds; specialty programs, including Taekwondo, soccer, music, and chess, that foster teamwork and leadership; and our Z Lab, which gives students space to innovate, experiment, and think critically.<br /><br />To learn more, <font face=\"Tahoma\"><a href=\"https://zetaschools.org/events-for-prospective-families/\" target=\"_blank\" part=\"link\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><u>come visit us at Zeta</u></a></font><a href=\"https://zetaschools.org/events-for-prospective-families/\" target=\"_blank\" part=\"link\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><u></u></a>.<br /><br />I look forward to getting to know your family and sharing more about Zeta.<br /><br /><strong>With warmth &amp; gratitude,<br /><br />Emily Kim<br />Founder, CEO &amp; Zeta Mom<br />Zeta Charter Schools</strong><strong><br /></strong><br /><em>Please reach out if you have any questions about Zeta. Our Enrollment Team is here for you every step of the way:<br /></em>✉︎ <a href=\"mailto:enroll&#64;zetaschools.org\" target=\"_blank\" part=\"link\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">enroll&#64;zetaschools.org</a><br />&#x1f4de;<a href=\"tel:16464801654\" target=\"_blank\" part=\"link\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">(646) 480-1654</a></font><a href=\"tel:16464801654\" target=\"_blank\" part=\"link\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"></a><a href=\"tel:16464801654\" target=\"_blank\" part=\"link\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"></a><br />"
            },
